# Frontend

- Pages in `src/app/[locale]/` stay thin. Screens and widgets live in `src/components/<feature>/`.
- shadcn primitives stay in `src/components/ui/`. Do not edit them to add business UI — wrap them.
- Data fetching and step logic live in hooks (`src/hooks/form/…`), not inside JSX.
- Auth: `getServerSession` in server layouts; `useSession` on the client. Gate by role (`admin`, `driver`, `partner`).
- Copy: `useTranslations()` / `getTranslations()`. Dictionaries: `messages/{locale}.json` (all 8 locales). Never show raw API or Zod English.
- Public wizard: `src/components/form/` (steps 1–3). Do not fork a fourth step without updating indicators and i18n.
- Links are `<Link>` from `@/i18n/navigation` or `next/link`. Don't `onClick` navigate (breaks open-in-new-tab).
- Forms: visible `Label htmlFor`, `autoComplete`, correct `type`. Errors next to the field.
- Prefer uncontrolled inputs; controlled inputs must stay cheap.
- Colocate feature files. Do not grow a 400-line page — extract.
- Admin/driver/partner chrome is a tool: tables, status, actions. Public form is conversion: price and trust first.
